#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:2
msgid "``404 Not Found`` pages"
msgstr "``404 Not Found`` 页面"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:4
msgid ""
"If you want your project to use a custom or branded ``404 Not Found`` page, "
"you can put a ``404.html`` or ``404/index.html`` at the top level of your "
"project's HTML output."
msgstr ""
"若希望项目使用自定义或品牌化的 ``404 Not Found`` 页面，可在项目 HTML 输出的顶层放置 ``404.html`` 或 "
"``404/index.html``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:8
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:10
msgid ""
"When our servers return a ``404 Not Found`` error, we check if there is a "
"``404.html`` or ``404/index.html`` in the root of your project's output."
msgstr ""
"当我们的服务器返回 ``404 Not Found`` 错误时，会检查项目输出根目录是否存在 ``404.html`` 或 "
"``404/index.html``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:13
msgid "The following locations are checked, in order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序检查位置："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:15
msgid "``/404.html`` or ``404/index.html`` in the *current* documentation version."
msgstr "*当前* 文档版本中的 ``/404.html`` 或 ``404/index.html``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:16
msgid "``/404.html`` or ``404/index.html`` in the *default* documentation version."
msgstr "*默认* 文档版本中的 ``/404.html`` 或 ``404/index.html``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:19
msgid "Tool integration"
msgstr "工具集成"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:21
msgid ""
"Documentation tools will have different ways of generating a ``404.html`` or"
" ``404/index.html`` file. We have examples for some of the most popular "
"tools below."
msgstr "不同文档工具生成 ``404.html`` 或 ``404/index.html`` 的方式各不相同。下面给出一些最常用工具的示例。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:26
msgid "Sphinx"
msgstr "Sphinx"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:28
msgid ""
"We recommend the `sphinx-notfound-page`_ extension, which Read the Docs "
"maintains. It automatically creates a ``404.html`` page for your "
"documentation, matching the theme of your project. See its documentation_ "
"for how to install and customize it."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用由 Read the Docs 维护的 `sphinx-notfound-page`_ 扩展。它会自动为你的文档创建与项目主题匹配的 "
"``404.html`` 页面。安装与定制方法见其 documentation_。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:34
msgid ""
"If you want to create a custom ``404.html``, Sphinx uses the "
"`html_extra_path`_ option to add static files to the output. You need to "
"create a ``404.html`` file and put it under the path defined in "
"``html_extra_path``."
msgstr ""
"若要创建自定义 ``404.html``，Sphinx 使用 `html_extra_path`_ 选项将静态文件加入输出。你需要创建 "
"``404.html`` 文件并放到 ``html_extra_path`` 定义的路径下。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you are using the ``DirHTML`` builder, no further steps are required. "
"Sphinx will automatically apply the ``<page-name>/index.html`` folder "
"structure to your 404 page: ``404/index.html``. Read the Docs also detects "
"404 pages named this way."
msgstr ""
"若使用 ``DirHTML`` 构建器，无需额外步骤。Sphinx 会自动对 404 页面应用 ``<page-name>/index.html`` "
"目录结构，即 ``404/index.html``。Read the Docs 也能识别这种命名的 404 页面。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:44
msgid "MkDocs"
msgstr "MkDocs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/404-not-found.rst:46
msgid ""
"MkDocs automatically generates a ``404.html`` which Read the Docs will use. "
"However, assets will not be loaded correctly unless you define the "
"`site_url`_ configuration value as your site's :doc:`canonical base URL "
"</canonical-urls>`."
msgstr ""
"MkDocs 会自动生成 ``404.html``，Read the Docs 将使用它。但除非将 `site_url`_ 配置值设为你站点的 "
":doc:`规范基础 URL </canonical-urls>`，否则静态资源无法正确加载。"

